 "inter": [],
 "structural_change": "QW-CLUSTER3 safe3 redesign of the Q slice after q2 gate OT_HOLD_STALL NEEDS_RTL (46 R2R FF hold -7.8 ps after 3 h repair; classes: fold skew delay-line dl flop->flop chains, adder data-reset pipeline) and reset fanout 5,138 on one fold leaf: (1) every fold skew delay line (u_xf D=7/14 x 128b, 2,688 flops) moved to fixed-offset SRAM rings (ot_coll_nring, 4 x 128x64 dual-clock natives, same D-edge age); (2) package-fold constant-zero sources g>=2 tied to 0 (their delay lines only ever held 0; adders kept, latency unchanged); (3) adder data reset off (DRST 0: valid bits only; consumers qualify by valid); (4) reset leaves split: Q 3 leaves, each fold seam leaf + one per stage, all <= 32 sinks, same release edge; zero added cycles. Outline 302.4x259.2 (aspect 1.17) from q2 synth std 25.7k um2 minus removed flops (~23.5k) at ~0.5 util; third macro stack at x=216 on the 43.2 lattice. Fallback q3w: 345.6x259.2, stacks at x=43.2/151.2/259.2.",
